        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVNEW19ENTR, Keyed Entry Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate is a single cylinder entryset so the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turnknob on the interior while the levers operate the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and the interior. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Newport Keyed Entry Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate has rope detailing on the lever for a classic maritime look that is great for high-end coastal homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/rope-newport-lever-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favnew19\"><b>Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Grandeur Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Newport Leverset with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/grandeur/GRA-FAVNEWENTR-specifications.pdf\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVNEW19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
