                "description": "The Keyed Entry Newport Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate is a single cylinder entryset so the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turnknob on the interior while the levers operate the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and the interior. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Newport Keyed Entry Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate has rope detailing on the lever for a classic maritime look that is great for high-end coastal homes.\r\n",
